   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, <div><br></div><div>I am having an issue with converting 6-column gtf to 12-column BED that is required MethylKit. I have looked at the answers provided within this group and also on Biostars but they have not worked. </div><div><br></div><div>I am getting the following error when reading in the annotation file: </div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">gene</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fusarium</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">obj</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">readTranscriptFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Fusarium_graminearum.RR.31.bed&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br>error:</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">Reading</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> the table</span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Calculating</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> intron coordinates</span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">ref</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">ref</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> invalid </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;times&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> argument<br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> addition</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Warning</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> message</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">`[.data.frame`</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">ref</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">ref</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">ref</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">NAs</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> introduced </span><span style=\"color:#008\">by</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> coercion<br><br></span></div></code></div><div><br><br></div><div><br></div><div>the BED file was created from the gtf file downloaded from Ensembl Fungi and converted using:</div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">awk </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;{ if ($0 ~ &quot;transcript_id&quot;) print $0; else print $0&quot; transcript_id \\&quot;\\&quot;;&quot;; }&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Fusarium_graminearum</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">RR</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">31.gtf</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">|</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> gtf2bed </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Fusarium_graminearum</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">RR</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">31.bed</span></div></code></div><div><br><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Any help is much appreciated</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
