    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I just wanted to put the solution I found for anyone with similar issue:<div><br></div><div>I used UCSC tool gtfToGenePred and used the output as input of genePredToBed.<br></div><div><br></div><div>Download links:</div><div>gtfToGenePred <a href=\"http://hgdownload.cse.ucsc.edu/admin/exe/linux.x86_64/gtfToGenePred\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://hgdownload.cse.ucsc.edu/admin/exe/linux.x86_64/gtfToGenePred&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793231816674000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1z5RYwFYpJDaqisj4Ush9b\">http://hgdownload.cse.ucsc.edu/admin/exe/linux.x86_64/gtfToGenePred</a><br></div><div>genePredToBed <a href=\"http://hgdownload.cse.ucsc.edu/admin/exe/linux.x86_64/genePredToBed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://hgdownload.cse.ucsc.edu/admin/exe/linux.x86_64/genePredToBed&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793231816674000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0lOCw6w9lalMTzF6i1F2k4\">http://hgdownload.cse.ucsc.edu/admin/exe/linux.x86_64/genePredToBed</a><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Hope this helps others.</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
